verses.text:
My God, my God, hurry to my side;
support me and set me free,
and deliver my soul from those who kill.{b}

My soul praises him and exalts him
for all his kindnesses,
which he has done and will do for me.

Gather together to make known his strength;
do not be slow to show his deliverance,
and his glory to all the simple.{b}

and like one who offers he-goats and young bulls,
and like one who makes the altar shine with a great number of burnt offerings,
and like the fragrance of spices from the hand of the righteous.{e}
